Package: teamtreck-agent
Version: 0.18.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: TeamTreck <support@teamtreck.example>
Description: TeamTreck desktop time-tracking agent
 Background agent that syncs time entries, screenshots, and activity
 monitoring with a TeamTreck server. Pairs with the browser extension
 for URL tracking (see /usr/share/teamtreck-agent/browser-extension).
